  "task": "We're investigating a sudden cluster of waterborne illness cases in Coastal Bay County potentially linked to contaminated water sources. First, confirm environmental contamination levels and affected population demographics; then if thresholds are exceeded, declare a public health emergency and close high-risk recreational facilities; finally authorize emergency treatment protocols and verify medical resource availability for outbreak response."
